#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Is Biosafety Land?"
msgstr "Ma Dhul Badbaadada Bayoolaji ahbaa?"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Indicates whether this is a Biosafety Land instance."
msgstr "Waxay tilmaamaysaa in kani yahay tusaale Dhul Badbaadada Bayoolaji ah."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Field Behavior Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Dhaqanka Goobta"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Field Visibility Control"
msgstr "Daar Kontoroolka Muuqashada Goobta"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Show/hide fields based on content type selection. Controls URL, date, and published fields visibility."
msgstr "Tus/qari goobaha ku salaysan doorashada nooca nuxurka. Waxay kontarooshaa URL, taariikhda, iyo muuqashada goobaha la daabacay."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Additional Fields"
msgstr "Daar Goobo Dheeraad ah"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Add content-type specific additional fields (event statuses, project statuses, etc.) based on thesaurus content type."
msgstr "Ku dar goobo dheeraad ah oo u gaar ah nooca nuxurka (heerarka dhacdooyinka, heerarka mashaariicda, iwm.) oo ku salaysan nooca nuxurka thesaurus."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Auto Summary"
msgstr "Daar Soo Koobid Toos ah"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Automatically generate summary from body content as user types."
msgstr "Si toos ah uga soo saar soo koobid nuxurka jidhka marka isticmaaluhu wax qorayo."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Enable Field Help Comments"
msgstr "Daar Faallooyinka Caawinta Goobta"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Display contextual help comments for fields based on content type."
msgstr "Soo bandhig faallooyin caawimaad ah oo macnaha guud ku saleysan goobaha ku xiran nooca nuxurka."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Field Visibility Rules"
msgstr "Xeerarka Muuqashada Goobta"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Define custom field visibility rules (JSON format)."
msgstr "Qeex xeerar gaar ah oo muuqashada goobta ah (qaabka JSON)."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Translation Defaults"
msgstr "Dejinta Turjumaada ee Asalka ah"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Configure creation of translation defaults (language placeholders) for translatable entities."
msgstr "Habee abuurista dejinta turjumaada ee asalka ah (boos-hayayaasha luqadda) ee cutubyada la turjumi karo."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Automatically create translation defaults"
msgstr "Si toos ah u abuur dejinta turjumaada ee asalka ah"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "When enabled, translation defaults (placeholders) are created for other languages at entity create/update. Existing translations with proper source are not overwritten."
msgstr "Marka la daaro, dejinta turjumaada ee asalka ah (boos-hayayaasha) ayaa loo abuuraa luqadaha kale marka la abuurayo/cusboonaysiinayo cutubka. Turjumaadaha jira ee leh isha saxda ah lama dul qorayo."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Use all available languages"
msgstr "Isticmaal dhammaan luqadaha la heli karo"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "When enabled, translations will be created for all languages installed on the site. When disabled, only the selected target languages below will be used."
msgstr "Marka la daaro, turjumaado ayaa loo abuuri doonaa dhammaan luqadaha ku rakiban bogga. Marka la damiyo, kaliya luqadaha bartilmaameedka ah ee hoos ku xusan ayaa la isticmaali doonaa."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Target languages for translation defaults"
msgstr "Luqadaha bartilmaameedka u ah dejinta turjumaada ee asalka ah"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Select which languages to create translation defaults for. Used only when \"Use all available languages\" is disabled."
msgstr "Dooro luqadaha loo abuurayo dejinta turjumaada ee asalka ah. Waxaa la isticmaalaa kaliya marka \"Isticmaal dhammaan luqadaha la heli karo\" la damiyo."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Copy source field values"
msgstr "Nuqul ka samee qiyamka goobta isha"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "When enabled, translatable field values from the source language will be copied to new translations."
msgstr "Marka la daaro, qiyamka goobta la turjumi karo ee luqadda isha ayaa loo guurin doonaa turjumaadaha cusub."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Entity types"
msgstr "Noocyada cutubyada"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Select which entity types should have translation defaults created."
msgstr "Dooro noocyada cutubyada ee loo abuurayo dejinta turjumaada ee asalka ah."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Batch Operations"
msgstr "Hawlgallada Dufcadda ah"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Process existing entities to create missing translation defaults."
msgstr "Ka shaqee cutubyada jira si aad u abuurto dejinta turjumaada ee asalka ah ee maqan."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Entity type to process"
msgstr "Nooca cutubka ee la shaqeynayo"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "- Select -"
msgstr "- Dooro -"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Select an entity type to create translations for existing entities."
msgstr "Dooro nooc cutub si aad turjumaado ugu abuurto cutubyada jira."

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Create translation defaults for existing entities"
msgstr "U abuur dejinta turjumaada ee asalka ah cutubyada jira"

#: src/Form/BiolandSettingsForm.php
msgid "Please select an entity type to process."
msgstr "Fadlan dooro nooc cutub si aad uga shaqeyso."

